  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"315\" data-end=\"545\" id=\"isPasted\">Mrs. Toddy’s Tonic is an Australian brand making sparkling tonics that bring the flavour, the fizz, and the feel-good. Inspired by island energy and made to stand out, we’re here to make wellness more fun.</p><hr data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"550\"><p data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"757\"><strong data-start=\"552\" data-end=\"575\">Product description</strong><br data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"578\">We make sparkling, non-alcoholic tonics crafted with real fruit extracts and natural botanicals. Refreshing, flavour-forward, and made to look great in your hand and on your feed.</p><hr data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"762\"><p data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"948\"><strong data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"794\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong><br data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"797\">Stylish branding, bold flavours, and a strong visual presence. A premium, non-alcoholic option that doesn’t compromise on taste, vibe, or shelf appeal.</p><hr data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"953\"><p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1079\"><strong data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"972\">Payment terms</strong><br data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"975\">15% commission on all referred sales. 30-day cookie window. No minimum payout. Fast, automatic payments.</p><hr data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1084\"><p data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1288\"><strong data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1107\">Other information</strong><br data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1110\">Great fit for lifestyle creators, wellness influencers, and anyone with good taste. We provide branded assets, promo codes, and easy setup so you can start earning straight away.</p><hr data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1293\"><p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1419\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Let me know if you want a punchy <strong data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1345\">program title</strong> to go with it (e.g. “Sip &amp; Earn with Mrs. Toddy’s”) — I can add that too.</p></div></div>",
